  "boundary": "The selected tag-0x0C reader consumes header 8 and the common byte/three-DWORD prefix, then BlackboardString, TargetSettings, a direct List<GameplayTag>, and one terminal byte. The paired payload and target retain their independent bounded profiles. The list framing reuses buff_0b_native.json and its GameplayTag elements reuse the conditional FF-or-header1 DWORD profile in buff_c5_native.json. Static generic identity does not establish live list provider selection. Payload/member meaning, suffix ownership, and whole-BuffData EOF remain unresolved."
